{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040940/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.poster.avif?t=1758457645\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040940/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.webm?t=1758457645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040940/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.mp4?t=1758457645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd52 24 Hour Day Cycle &amp; A Large Map to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This city reveals a new face every hour. Start working in the morning, find a safe spot at night.   <br>Manage your time well money is always needed to survive in this sprawling city!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267b\ufe0f Recycling System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash isn\u2019t just waste it\u2019s survival.   <br>Gather bottles, cans, scrap, and sell them at recycling centers to earn money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd32 Begging Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes asking for help is your only option. Approach people and ask for cash or food.   <br>Be warned not everyone here is kind. Some will ignore you, others may demand more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Theft System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seems unethical? Maybe. But the streets are ruthless.   <br>Be cunning and discreet a wallet or some food could keep you going another day.   <br>But if you're caught, the police won\u2019t show mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included in This Demo?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Area:</strong> City center starting zone with a safe spot to rest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time System:</strong> 24-hour cycle (day and night) included in the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanics Available:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycling System (collect and sell bottles, cans, scrap).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begging Mechanic (ask NPCs for money or food).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theft System (steal items with risk of being caught).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelter Mechanic (find safe shelters at night to protect your money from theft; each shelter provides different daily bonuses).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop System (worldwide shops where you can buy survival items; shop stocks refresh daily with random items).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Session Length:</strong> Approximately 20\u201330 minutes of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limitations:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress does not carry over to the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the city center is accessible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some advanced mechanics from the full version are locked.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040940?t=1758457645","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040940/dd6e28f4d3b55341d207cb6ad8d7e372452d8978/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758457645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040940/669ddc8d366ad5e273a3db73b0b420b18af47c25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758457645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040940/669ddc8d366ad5e273a3db73b0b420b18af47c25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758457645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":